Stones n Boat:
Sailing through a narrow passageway with zero room for error, one miscalculation and you'll divebomb to the rocks. Think you can handle it Captain?

Controls: 
- W/Up Arrow to go forward
- S/Down Arrow to go back
- AD/LeftRight arrow to turn

Now go out there and set sail. Dev got 40 on the scoreline, can you beat that?